{'symbol': 'SYF', 'date': '2021-10-21 16:30:00', 'title': 'SYNCHRONY ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $0.22 PER SHARE', 'text': 'STAMFORD, CONN., OCT. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL (NYSE: SYF) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.22 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 12, 2021 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOVEMBER 1, 2021.'}